  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Allenstown, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Us  \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Forms & Documents  \t\t\t \n     Business Directory  \t\t\t \n     TextMyGov  \t\t\t \n     Town Clerk/Tax Collector  \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Town Municipal Elections Results \r\n\t\t\t Application for Absentee Ballot \r\n\t\t\t Assessing Abatements Current Use Exemptions Tax Appeals \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Building Permits \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Elections Information \r\n\t\t\t Forms \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Transactions \r\n\t\t\t NH DMV website \r\n\t\t\t NH Tax Kiosk \r\n\t\t\t New Resident and General Town Information and Directory \r\n\t\t\t OHRV Registrations and Hunting & Fishing Licenses - Not Available at Allenstown Town Hall at this time. \r\n\t\t\t Police Fines and Citations \r\n\t\t\t Property Taxes and Assessed Values \r\n\t\t\t Tax Rate History \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information Look Up \r\n\t\t\t Intention of Marriage Worksheet \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nStaff \nJacquelene Tate, Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nPhone: 603-485-4276, ext. 116 \nMatt LaFlamme, Deputy Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nPhone: 603-485-4276, ext. 111 \nOverview \nOnline Services can be found on the Home Page on the bottom left-hand side of the page. \nMonday 8:30 am to 7 pm. \nTuesday through Thursday, 8:30 am to 4:30 pm. \nClosed Friday through Sunday \nAddress \n16 School Street \nAllenstown, NH 03275 \nServices of Justice of the Peace and Notary Public are available at Town Hall through the Town Clerk and Finance Department \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJacquelene Tate\r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector\t \r\nPhone:  603-485-4276 Ext. 116 \r\nMore Information \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Allenstown Town Hall 16 School Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Allenstown ,  NH   03275 \r\nAllenstown Town Hall 16 School Street  Allenstown NH 03275 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  (603) 485-4276 Ext. 116 \r\nHours of Operation \nMonday: 8:30 am to 7 pm.  \nTuesday through Thursday: 8:30 am to 4:30 pm.  \nTax Payments, Dogs, Permit Payments, Transfer Station Payments, Parking Tickets, Vital Statistics, and Motor Vehicle Registrations are available at this time.  \nCall and leave a message if no one answers, if you have specific questions! 603-485- 4276 X116  \nFriday: Closed \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Contacts Directory \r\n\t\t\t E-Alerts \r\n\t\t\t FAQ \r\n\t\t\t Employment & Volunteer Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Public Schools \r\n\t\t\t Bids & RFPs \r\nTown of Allenstown \r\n16 School Street \r\nAllenstown, NH 03275 \r\nPhone:  (603) 485-4276 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
